        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9025/305, 12 Inch New Yorker Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith a 12 inch mounting center, the Omnia 9025/305 cabinet handle is great for larger cabinets to make a bold (and modern) statement. The New Yorker 12 Inch Cabinet Pull's rectangular shape makes it great for contemporary spaces. The available finishes are some of the most popular in the home decorating world right now. This New Yorker 12 Inch Cabinet Pull comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9025\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-4-inch-mid-century-modern-cabinet-hardware-omnia-9025-102\"><b>4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-6-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-153\"><b>6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-8-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-10-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-254\"><b>10 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-18-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-457\"><b>18 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9025 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
